goes in my favor.

448
00:22:10.801 --> 00:22:14.803
What are you, like CIA, FBI?

449
00:22:14.838 --> 00:22:16.838
Family law.

450
00:22:16.873 --> 00:22:20.072
I sit in a small office all day
combing through spreadsheets

451
00:22:20.107 --> 00:22:23.878
