in the process of a divorce.

452
00:22:23.913 --> 00:22:26.419
So, that's what all the
paperwork in your car is for?

453
00:22:26.454 --> 00:22:27.893
I mean, like you
care about it enough

454
00:22:27.917 --> 00:22:29.917
