517
00:26:05.805 --> 00:26:08.971
Oo, it's gettin' a little
steamy over here, Rudolph.

518
00:26:09.006 --> 00:26:10.170
Don't ya think?

519
00:26:12.845 --> 00:26:14.141
Tasha?

520
00:26:15.848 --> 00:26:17.408
Oh, I see Nat
got you up to speed

521
00:26:17.443 --> 00:26:19.377
