751
00:39:21.798 --> 00:39:24.700
Oh my God, can you
be any more pathetic?

752
00:39:24.735 --> 00:39:26.438
She's the worst.

753
00:39:26.473 --> 00:39:28.836
She's literally the worst
choice you can make.

754
00:39:28.871 --> 00:39:30.739
You're never gonna
know what she wants

755
