1591
01:28:01.913 --> 01:28:05.816
When she does, that girl is
gonna be wilder than ever.

1592
01:28:12.825 --> 01:28:15.925
I'm gonna clean
that money for you.

1593
01:28:15.960 --> 01:28:18.059
You don't have to worry
where it came from.

1594
01:28:18.094 --> 01:28:19.698
Thanks.

1595
