helluva lotta baggage?

1601
01:28:39.115 --> 01:28:40.653
Yeah.

1602
01:28:40.688 --> 01:28:42.424
I can handle it.

1603
01:28:42.459 --> 01:28:44.492
- Can you?
- Yeah.

1604
01:29:02.611 --> 01:29:04.809
You did your
brother justice, Jimmy.

1605
