He's in the water now.

1606
01:29:06.714 --> 01:29:09.814
And eventually, he'll
visit every beach there is.

1607
01:29:09.849 --> 01:29:11.552
You know what?

1608
01:29:11.587 --> 01:29:12.883
I love the way you think.

